### Notes for the consumer side
- `getters.stoppedOrFailedChats` → array `{ chatId, status, reason, messageId, at }` (newest first).
- `getters.chatIssue(chatId)` / `isChatStopped(chatId)` / `isChatFailed(chatId)` for per-card badges.
- Cleared automatically by a retry (`startChatProcessing`) or a healthy stream/done event; re-detected from the loaded conversation on `loadChat` / `findProjectChat` / `reloadChat`, so the list survives a page reload for chats whose last run failed or was stopped.

